#. ~ Description of "vancian bill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
msgid ""
"A small bill covered in odd symbols.  Tearing it will in turn cause a small "
"dimensional tear located within a nearby entity.  Despite only lasting a few "
"milliseconds, an internal tear in reality should be enough to kill anything."
"  Hopefully."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
