#. ~ Description of "cosmic dagwood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
msgid ""
"The greatest sandwich that will ever be made, in this universe and the next."
"  A quadruple stacker with beer-batter fried poultry, caramel chocolate "
"chili, and topped with a specially made sauce of egg, blue cheese, honey "
"mustard, BBQ and extremely concentrated vinegar that oozes down the other "
"layers, before the entire thing is pressed and grilled in a waffle iron and "
"finished with a garnish of gold and silver flakes and a fresh fruit skewered "
"on top.  All the gourmet chefs in existence could not even conceive such a "
"combination which, by all means, should not taste this good - But you did it."
"  And you don't plan on sharing."
msgstr ""

