#. ~ Description of "netherium warp grenade"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
msgid ""
"A homemade general purpose reality implosion device.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and start the fuse.  After 5 seconds, everything nearby will be "
"violently sliced, warped, aged, and partially teleported straight into many "
"different sections of the nether.  After a short moment of instant death, the"
" dimensional gap will probably heal.  Probably."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/consumables.json
